      "settings": {
        "text": "Is IPL right for you?",
        "text1": "IPL works by targeting melanin (pigment), so its effectiveness depends on the melanin levels in both the skin and hair. As a result, IPL may be less effective on lighter hair colors due to lower melanin levels, and it could pose safety concerns for darker skin tones, which absorb higher levels of energy due to their higher melanin content.",
        "text2": "Skin tones",
        "text3": "Hair colours",
        "text4": "Note: IPL technology is most effective on dark hair and fair skin. It is least effective on blonde, grey, and red hair, and is not suitable for use on very dark skin.",
